{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aPONPON TOWN\u300b is a desktop idle game that you can play while you are doing other things! Collect over a dozen adorable marble animal villagers, gather resources, and build your village\u2014all without interrupting your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/179db430b8c671a6323512dabbb323e3.poster.avif?t=1752892512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/179db430b8c671a6323512dabbb323e3.webm?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/179db430b8c671a6323512dabbb323e3.mp4?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf89 A brand-new idle bouncer experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your cute villagers roll around the screen, collecting coins, wood, and mysterious materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/aaec4fcd01d03208cbb9353ba83be760.poster.avif?t=1752892512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/aaec4fcd01d03208cbb9353ba83be760.webm?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/aaec4fcd01d03208cbb9353ba83be760.mp4?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1fCollect cute animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chubby hamsters, stinky piglets, and chill capybaras! Gather all the cute animal villagers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f96ba0ae708f1b894a620290226644d7.poster.avif?t=1752892512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f96ba0ae708f1b894a620290226644d7.webm?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f96ba0ae708f1b894a620290226644d7.mp4?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fEasy to create and build during work breaks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual and relaxing game atmosphere, make full use of your desktop space and build your own cute village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/4d504afab0114bfe86b28a2f276914fc.poster.avif?t=1752892512\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/4d504afab0114bfe86b28a2f276914fc.webm?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/4d504afab0114bfe86b28a2f276914fc.mp4?t=1752892512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687170?t=1752892512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687170?t=1752892512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/dc56d68aeb190dc328f4430a14f04b12ef98857a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752892512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/dc56d68aeb190dc328f4430a14f04b12ef98857a/capsu